{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35182","headline":"送入蕃使 · 周繇","name":"送入蕃使","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"猎猎旗幡过大荒，敕书犹带御烟香。\n滹沱河冻军回探，逻逤城孤雁着行。\n远寨风狂移帐幕，平沙日晚卧牛羊。\n早终册礼朝天阙，莫遣虬髭染塞霜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周繇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35182.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35182","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}